            "review_title": "Review at Lalabay Seafood Buffet Restaurant - Ha Long",
            "review_text": "Trang Nhung\nHanoi, Vietnam2 contributions\n0\nFresh, diverse seafood\nFeb 2026 • Family\nOne big plus is that it''s right near the Fire District, which is always convenient to pass by the sea. Our house was accidentally crammed into, and it was pretty big. Mid-week is not peak season, so luckily. The seafood buffet to eat is also comfortable, and the seafood in Ha Long is a must, very fresh and delicious. After travel, Ha Long will come again. Thank you very helpful, attentive staff\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten March 11, 2026",
