            "review_title": "Review at Lalabay Seafood Buffet Restaurant - Ha Long",
            "review_text": "Guide46345754053\n2 contributions\n0\nDon’t trust what they say\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nDon't eat here. They are liars and cheaters. We were allowed to look at the buffet beforehand and asked if there was pork in the dishes, the manager said that everything was beef. In the end, all the dishes that had meat were made with pork. Even the sushi was with sausage (pork). We had ordered lobster and got four half crayfish, of course we were charged a whole one (4 lobsters) for each half. When we asked the manager about this, she forgot how to speak English during the conversation. Luckily we had a local with us who spoke to the manager for us.\nWritten March 9, 2024",
